---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="PS5 vs Xbox: Where to Buy Digital Games Cheaper"
  description="A practical comparison of where to buy digital games cheapest on PS5 vs Xbox Series, including wallet credits, key stores, and subscription perks."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>PS5 vs Xbox: Where to Buy Digital Games Cheaper</h1>
    <p class="meta">Roundup · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      Both consoles are digital-friendly, but the <em>cheapest place to buy</em>
      differs by ecosystem. Here's the practical breakdown.
    </p>

    <h2>PlayStation 5</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>PlayStation Store</strong> — fixed first-party pricing, but regular wallet-credit sales (buy $100 credit for ~$85–90)</li>
      <li><strong>Key resellers (GMG, etc.)</strong> — sometimes beat Store pricing on PSN wallet codes</li>
      <li><strong>PS Plus</strong> — monthly free games and deeper catalog access on higher tiers</li>
    </ul>
    <AffiliateLink network="gmg" href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=marvel+spiderman+2+ps5" cta="PS5 games at GMG" />

    <h2>Xbox Series X|S</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Microsoft Store</strong> — frequent "Deals with Gold" and owner discounts</li>
      <li><strong>Xbox Game Pass</strong> — the best value if you play a lot; day-one first-party titles included</li>
      <li><strong>Key resellers</strong> — strong for cross-gen CoD and EA titles</li>
    </ul>
    <AffiliateLink network="gmg" href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=call+of+duty+black+ops+6" cta="Xbox games at GMG" />

    <h2>Cross-platform buying tip</h2>
    <p>
      For multi-platform titles like <em>Call of Duty</em> or <em>EA Sports FC</em>,
      a digital key from a third-party store usually undercuts both console stores.
      Buy on the platform your friends play on for co-op, but shop the key stores for
      price.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to compare</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li><AffiliateLink network="gmg" href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=call+of+duty+black+ops+6" cta="GMG" /></li>
      <li><AffiliateLink network="humble" href="https://www.humblebundle.com/store?search=ea+sports+fc+25" cta="Humble" /></li>
      <li><AffiliateLink network="amazon" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Call+of+Duty+Black+Ops+6" cta="Amazon" /></li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
